to keep\nOnly headlights moving through the sleep\n\n[Outro]\nThe room is quiet, the tape runs thin\nBut something warmer is coming in", 222, "fixed", 120, 1.7, 50], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 73, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_duration"}, "name": "max_duration", "label": "max_duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "max_duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}], "flags": {}, "id": 45, "type": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"seed": true, "top_k": true, "caption": true, "lyrics": true, "max_duration": true, "cfg_scale": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 📬 联系方式与资源\n\n## - **微信**：`yujian5455`\n## - **QQ群**：[108894549](https://qm.qq.com/q/1hpmJF4aCg)\n## - **抖音主页**：[点击访问](https://v.douyin.com/iPM3A3nE)\n## - **B站主页**：[点击访问](https://space.bilibili.com/3546373907548208)\n## - **RunningHub主页**：[点击访问](https://www.runninghub.cn/user-center/1909412248656175106)\n## - **工具箱（实时更新）**：[点击查看](https://aae1wrb5y2t.feishu.cn/sheets/NceEscs36hoRUNtb47zcpSEvnpd)\n\n---\n\n# - **付费课程**：[点击学习](https://m.shifangwk.cn/channel/1858936?st=sharelink&inviter_id=155127763)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote"